    {
      "id": "25218816",
      "title": "Rendering A List Of (Dummy) Meetups",
      "lectureOrder": 430,
      "videoOrder": 397,
      "sourceHash": "0520cca45a12ea763602c5d9a14a359ce39c666c1653d3a0367fff28ee09b1a5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 4.87,
          "en": "So for filling those pages with life,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.87,
          "end": 7.15,
          "en": "I will start with that starting page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.15,
          "end": 9.97,
          "en": "So with index.js in the pages folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.97,
          "end": 11.823,
          "en": "with this index.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.75,
          "end": 15.16,
          "en": "In there, we can add our component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.16,
          "end": 17.34,
          "en": "for example, the homepage component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.34,
          "end": 19.8,
          "en": "And of course also exports that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.8,
          "end": 21.62,
          "en": "that's always important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.62,
          "end": 25.09,
          "en": "And then we wanna return the JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.09,
          "end": 27.38,
          "en": "that defines this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.38,
          "end": 31.85,
          "en": "and that therefore defines what should show up on the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.85,
          "end": 34.99,
          "en": "And here, what should show up in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.99,
          "end": 39.16,
          "en": "is our meetup list component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.16,
          "end": 42.69,
          "en": "And that's a component that wants a meetups prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.69,
          "end": 45.35,
          "en": "which holds a list of meetups,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.35,
          "end": 48.57,
          "en": "which we then map into a list of JSX elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.57,
          "end": 51.33,
          "en": "Where every meetup needs to have an ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.33,
          "end": 54.23,
          "en": "an image, a title, and an address.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.23,
          "end": 57.68,
          "en": "And hence, when we use meetup lists in our page component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.68,
          "end": 60.81,
          "en": "we need to make sure that we do provide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.81,
          "end": 63.41,
          "en": "that meetups prop to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.41,
          "end": 66.22,
          "en": "It's also worth noting that meetup list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.22,
          "end": 68.35,
          "en": "like meetup item and so on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.35,
          "end": 71.28999999999999,
          "en": "is a regular React component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.28999999999999,
          "end": 73.95,
          "en": "It is however stored in a components' folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.95,
          "end": 76.27,
          "en": "not in a pages folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.27,
          "end": 78.12,
          "en": "Now that folder name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.12,
          "end": 79.8,
          "en": "The only reserved name in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.8,
          "end": 81.56,
          "en": "is the page's folder name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 81.56,
          "end": 84.6,
          "en": "You can name your other folders however you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.6,
          "end": 86.07,
          "en": "I named it components though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.07,
          "end": 89.14,
          "en": "because I do store React components in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.14,
          "end": 92.53,
          "en": "But the important difference to the page components is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 92.53,
          "end": 95.4,
          "en": "that those components stored in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 95.4,
          "end": 98.72999999999999,
          "en": "will not be loaded as pages automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 98.72999999999999,
          "end": 100.53999999999999,
          "en": "Instead, we can simply use them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 100.53999999999999,
          "end": 103.22,
          "en": "in the JSX code of other components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 103.22,
          "end": 105.93,
          "en": "including page components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 105.93,
          "end": 108.61,
          "en": "So we can include the meetup list component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.61,
          "end": 111.71000000000001,
          "en": "on our main page here, on the homepage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 111.71000000000001,
          "end": 114.31,
          "en": "Simply by going to that homepage component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 114.31,
          "end": 117.22999999999999,
          "en": "and importing meetup lists there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 117.22999999999999,
          "end": 120.23,
          "en": "from going up one level components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 120.23,
          "end": 121.65,
          "en": "meetups, meetup list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 123.35,
          "end": 126.11,
          "en": "So I import this component from this file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 126.11,
          "end": 127.95,
          "en": "and then we can use it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 127.95,
          "end": 129.6,
          "en": "And hence here we can, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 129.6,
          "end": 132.1,
          "en": "output meetup lists like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 132.1,
          "end": 134.19,
          "en": "and then set this meetups prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 134.19,
          "end": 136.43,
          "en": "which this component expects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 136.43,
          "end": 138.6,
          "en": "And for the moment we can then construct",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 138.6,
          "end": 140.38,
          "en": "some dummy meetups here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 140.38,
          "end": 141.98,
          "en": "later we'll be able to create",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 141.98,
          "end": 144.4,
          "en": "and store our own meetups in a database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 144.4,
          "end": 146.82,
          "en": "For the moment let's use some dummy meetups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 146.82,
          "end": 150.023,
          "en": "And that actually should be an array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 150.91,
          "end": 154.43,
          "en": "an array of meetup items where every item has an ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 154.43,
          "end": 157.6,
          "en": "for example M1 for the first meetup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 157.6,
          "end": 162.6,
          "en": "where every meetup then has a title like a first meetup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 163.25,
          "end": 166.03,
          "en": "where every meetup then has an image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 166.03,
          "end": 169.84,
          "en": "And for this here, I'm using an image from Wikipedia",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 169.84,
          "end": 171.93,
          "en": "which is not taken by me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 171.93,
          "end": 175.22,
          "en": "but which instead was taken by Tomas Wolf",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 175.22,
          "end": 178.02,
          "en": "to whom I therefore wanna give due credits.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 178.02,
          "end": 179.78,
          "en": "So this image is taken by him.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 179.78,
          "end": 182.07,
          "en": "And I'll just grab that image here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 182.07,
          "end": 184.15,
          "en": "grab the URL to that image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 184.15,
          "end": 187.15,
          "en": "because we're not going to implement file upload here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 187.15,
          "end": 190.323,
          "en": "and use that here as an image URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 191.63,
          "end": 196.14600000000002,
          "en": "Now, every meetup should then also have an address",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 196.14600000000002,
          "end": 198.34,
          "en": "because that's another piece of data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 198.34,
          "end": 202.13,
          "en": "which we extract in the meetup list component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 202.13,
          "end": 204.94,
          "en": "So we wanna have that address field here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 204.94,
          "end": 208.561,
          "en": "And I'll set this to some address 5,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 208.561,
          "end": 211.78,
          "en": "12345, Some City.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 211.78,
          "end": 213.93,
          "en": "And we can also add a description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 213.93,
          "end": 216.4,
          "en": "even though we don't need that yet, but I will add it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 216.4,
          "end": 220.7,
          "en": "A description with, \"this is our first meetup.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 220.7,
          "end": 223.4,
          "en": "And now we can of course replicate this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 223.4,
          "end": 224.81,
          "en": "So duplicate this meetup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 224.81,
          "end": 227.5,
          "en": "and give the second one an idea of M2",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 227.5,
          "end": 229.43,
          "en": "and then name it as second meetup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 229.43,
          "end": 231.55,
          "en": "and this is a second meetup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 231.55,
          "end": 233,
          "en": "And maybe change the address",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 233,
          "end": 235.92000000000002,
          "en": "and use a different image as well if you want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 235.92000000000002,
          "end": 237.57,
          "en": "I'll stick to the same one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 237.57,
          "end": 240.41,
          "en": "And then we can pass this dummy meetups array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 240.41,
          "end": 243.403,
          "en": "into this meetups prop of the meetup list component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 244.25,
          "end": 246.19,
          "en": "And that's all standard React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 246.19,
          "end": 249.4,
          "en": "There's nothing NextJS specific about that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 249.4,
          "end": 252.6,
          "en": "The only NextJS specific part here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 252.6,
          "end": 254.53,
          "en": "is that we're in a special component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 254.53,
          "end": 258.67,
          "en": "which is special because it's in such a page file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 258.67,
          "end": 262.15,
          "en": "Other than that, it's a regular React component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 262.15,
          "end": 263.58,
          "en": "And if we now save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 263.58,
          "end": 267.65,
          "en": "if we save this and restart our development server here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 267.65,
          "end": 271.24,
          "en": "because it crashed, because I had no page content initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 271.24,
          "end": 273.97,
          "en": "If we visit local host 3000",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 273.97,
          "end": 276.46,
          "en": "we should see this on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 276.46,
          "end": 280.4,
          "en": "This is not the finished look, but this shows that it works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 280.4,
          "end": 283.71,
          "en": "and that our first page has loaded successfully.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 283.71,
          "end": 287.37,
          "en": "And we're using another React component in that page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 287.37,
          "end": 290.40999999999997,
          "en": "a component which is not a page component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 290.40999999999997,
          "end": 292.283,
          "en": "that is also worth pointing out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 293.35,
          "end": 296.02,
          "en": "And with that, we got this page in place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 296.02,
          "end": 299.27,
          "en": "Let's now also work on that new meetup page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 299.27,
